# 5.1 Monado crashes (the Basalt SIGABRT) in a desk session: its clients exit as collateral (no budget), the subtree
# restarts after the 30 s backoff, the second crash waits 120 s, the third within 15 min opens the breaker.
start desk
at 10 exit monado sig=6
at 10 down wayvr passthrough ctrltrack perf
expect 11 health monado down
expect 11 health wayvr blocked
expect 11 overall down
expect 11 notified monado exited: crash
expect 39 runs 0
expect 41 ran start monado
expect 70 overall ok
at 100 exit monado sig=6
at 100 down wayvr passthrough ctrltrack perf
expect 219 runs 1
expect 221 ran start monado
expect 250 overall ok
at 300 exit monado sig=6
at 300 down wayvr passthrough ctrltrack perf
expect 302 health monado failed
expect 302 overall needs-you
expect 302 notified keeps failing
expect 700 runs 2
